      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Algo me dice que este Fennekin salvaje\nno se siente bien...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C0067006F0020006D006500200064006900630065002000710075006500200065007300740065002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002000730061006C00760061006A0065000A006E006F0020007300650020007300690065006E007400650020006200690065006E002E002E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fen...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460065006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No quiere la comida, y en el Centro Pokémon\nno saben decirme qué le pasa...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Se me ocurre que el dueño de la antigua\nHerboristería que había en la ciudad tal vez<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npueda ayudarnos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 111
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te molestaría ir a hablar con él mientras yo\nme quedo cuidando de Fennekin?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Suele ir a la Cafetería Prêt-à-Sorber, puede que\nlo encuentres ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750065006C0065002000690072002000610020006C00610020004300610066006500740065007200ED006100200050007200EA0074002D00E0002D0053006F0072006200650072002C0020007000750065006400650020007100750065000A006C006F00200065006E006300750065006E007400720065007300200061006800ED002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El dueño de la antigua Herboristería suele ir\na la Cafetería Prêt-à-Sorber.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dime, muchach<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, ¿qué se te ofrece?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006D0065002C0020006D00750063006800610063006800100003110000FF0101006F0061002C002000BF0071007500E90020007300650020007400650020006F00660072006500630065003F001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Trabajaba usted en una Herboristería?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00540072006100620061006A00610062006100200075007300740065006400200065006E00200075006E006100200048006500720062006F00720069007300740065007200ED0061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hay un Pokémon que no se siente bien",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007900200075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200071007500650020006E006F0020007300650020007300690065006E007400650020006200690065006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que hay un Fennekin enfermo... Entiendo...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007300ED0020007100750065002000680061007900200075006E002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00200065006E006600650072006D006F002E002E002E00200045006E007400690065006E0064006F002E002E002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los Fennekin comen ramitas para armarse\nde valor, o simplemente para calmarse.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si le das una Ramita Revitalizante, seguro que\nse recupera.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690020006C0065002000640061007300200075006E0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E00740065002C002000730065006700750072006F0020007100750065000A00730065002000720065006300750070006500720061002E001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La cosa es que las Ramitas Revitalizantes crecen\nen lo que ahora es la zona salvaje 5...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que es bastante peligroso ir a buscarlas,\nya que podrían atacarte los Pokémon salvajes.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi aun así quieres intentarlo, guíate por el olor\ndulzón que desprenden para encontrarlas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 190
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es posible encontrar Ramitas Revitalizantes\nen la zona salvaje 5, en el Distrito Azul.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPodrás distinguirlas por su olor dulzón.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está algo marchita... No parece que tenga\npropiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E100200061006C0067006F0020006D0061007200630068006900740061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061000A00700072006F007000690065006400610064006500730020007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La estuvieron mordisqueando... No parece que\ntenga propiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está rota... No parece que tenga propiedades\nrevitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E100200072006F00740061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061002000700072006F00700069006500640061006400650073000A007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Está seca y podrida... No parece que tenga\npropiedades revitalizantes.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1002000730065006300610020007900200070006F00640072006900640061002E002E002E0020004E006F00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000740065006E00670061000A00700072006F007000690065006400610064006500730020007200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E007400650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Despide un olor dulzón...\n¡Encontraste una Ramita Revitalizante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650073007000690064006500200075006E0020006F006C006F0072002000640075006C007A00F3006E002E002E002E000A00A10045006E0063006F006E00740072006100730074006500200075006E0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay que llevársela a Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007900200071007500650020006C006C0065007600E1007200730065006C006100200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una Ramita Revitalizante...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCaramba, tendré que darle las gracias al señor\nde la Herboristería... ¡y a ti por encontrarla!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dásela a Fennekin, rápido.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E100730065006C006100200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002C0020007200E1007000690064006F002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le diste la Ramita Revitalizante a Fennekin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020006400690073007400650020006C0061002000520061006D0069007400610020005200650076006900740061006C0069007A0061006E0074006500200061002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Kin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Se recuperó al instante! ¡Qué alegría!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300650020007200650063007500700065007200F300200061006C00200069006E007300740061006E007400650021002000A10051007500E900200061006C00650067007200ED0061002100100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que Fennekin se encariñó contigo.\n¿No te gustaría cuidarlo a partir de ahora?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Kin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Obtuviste un Fennekin!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004F0062007400750076006900730074006500200075006E002000460065006E006E0065006B0069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuídalo bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043007500ED00640061006C006F0020006200690065006E002E00100002011401880000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parece que tienes las cajas llenas.\nTendrás que hacer lugar si quieres a Fennekin.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
